{"id":35843723724,"name":"Run api tests","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAIWHPRzA","head_branch":"DHIS2-22148-43","head_sha":"0d42509acd892d485c4b3c2932affd91abd5c320","path":".github/workflows/run-api-tests.yml","run_number":53037,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"fix: align enrollment and event note exports DHIS2-22148 [43]","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":5591308,"check_suite_id":97053027476,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAAWmM-slA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/35843723724","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/35843723724","created_at":"2026-09-23T09:34:20Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T09:47:01Z","run_started_at":"2026-09-23T09:34:20Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/35843723724/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/35843723724/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/97053027476","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/35843723724/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/35843723724/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/35843723724/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"fix: align enrollment and event note exports DHIS2-22148 (#25340)\n\n* fix: align enrollment and event note exports DHIS2-22148\n\nJdbcEnrollmentStore inner joined userinfo on note.lastupdatedby, which is\nnullable, so notes without it were dropped from the export. Both event\nstores use a left join and return the note with no lastUpdatedBy.\n\nBoth event stores joined notes outside the paged subquery, so the join\nmultiplied rows: an event with 11 notes returned 11 copies of the full\nevent projection, deduped in Java afterwards. They now use the same\nlateral json_agg as enrollments, which aggregates per event.\n\nThe event note query dates back to 2016, carried through the later split\ninto JdbcTrackerEventStore and JdbcSingleEventStore. JdbcEnrollmentStore\nwas migrated to JDBC in May 2025 (DHIS2-19543) and written fresh, which\nis where the lateral came from.\n\n* refactor: extract shared JdbcNotes for note exports DHIS2-22148\n\nThe note lateral join, its JSON mapping and the JdbcNote DTO were\nduplicated across JdbcEnrollmentStore, JdbcTrackerEventStore and\nJdbcSingleEventStore. Three copies of the SQL and its mapper is how\nthese stores drifted apart in the first place, so move both into\nJdbcNotes where they cannot diverge. Only the link table, its column\nand the correlated owner column differ per store.\n\nMalformed JSON now throws IllegalStateException instead of logging the\npayload and returning an empty list. The JSON is produced by our own\njson_agg, so failing to parse it is a broken invariant, not bad user\ninput, and an empty list is indistinguishable from \"no notes\" to the\nclient. This matches Geometries and UserInfoSnapshots in the same\npackage. The payload is no longer logged as notes contain user data.\n\nParse through a static ObjectReader bound to List\u003cRow\u003e instead of\nallocating an ObjectMapper per row, which re-resolved the deserializer\non every event. Built from a plain ObjectMapper rather than\nJsonBinaryType.MAPPER, whose EmptyStringToNullStdDeserializer would map\nan empty note text to null and whose annotation introspector is scoped\nto Hibernate jsonb columns.\n\nAll three entities already cover this code via EnrollmentServiceTest,\nTrackerEventServiceTest and SingleEventServiceTest.\n\n* chore: shrink JdbcNotes javadoc DHIS2-22148","author":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"},"id":"0d42509acd892d485c4b3c2932affd91abd5c320","tree_id":"6aeb361de8f68e235f08b3e3650d8d98e8a83d2a","timestamp":"2026-09-23T09:32:16Z","committer":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/subscriptions"},"name":"dhis2-core","full_name":"dhis2/dhis2-core","description":"DHIS 2 Core. Written in Java. Contains the service layer and Web API.","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core","fork":false,"private":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/{archive_format}{/ref}","assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/assignees{/user}","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/git/blobs{/sha}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/branches{/branch}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/collaborators{/collaborator}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/comments{/number}","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/commits{/sha}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/compare/{base}...{head}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/conten